    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in any phase, right after one of your **ADEPTA SORORITAS** units suffers a [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds). Target that unit or an **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK** unit of yours no more than 3\" from it.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, these models gain [Feel No Pain](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain) 5+ versus mortal wounds:\n\n- models in the target unit\n- if the target is an **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK** unit, models in friendly **ADEPTA SORORITAS** units while those units are within 3\" of it",
